dex) {","         }","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Remove the pivot caches of the given (removed) pivot tables which no remaining pivot table uses:","+     * the {@code pivotCache} entry in the workbook, the workbook relationship and with it the","+     * pivot cache definition and records parts, which hold a copy of the pivot's source data.","+     */","+    private void removeUnusedPivotCaches(List<XSSFPivotTable> removedPivotTables) {","+        if (!workbook.isSetPivotCaches()) {","+            return;","+        }","+        Set<Long> usedCacheIds = new HashSet<>();","+        for (XSSFPivotTable pivotTable : pivotTables) {","+            usedCacheIds.add(pivotTable.getCTPivotTableDefinition().getCacheId());","+        }","+        Set<Long> unusedCacheIds = new HashSet<>();","+        for (XSSFPivotTable pivotTable : removedPivotTables) {","+            long cacheId = pivotTable.getCTPivotTableDefinition().getCacheId();","+            if (!usedCacheIds.contains(cacheId)) {","+                unusedCacheIds.add(cacheId);","+            }","+        }","+        CTPivotCaches caches = workbook.getPivotCaches();","+        for (int i = caches.sizeOfPivotCacheArray() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {","+            CTPivotCache cache = caches.getPivotCacheArray(i);","+            if (!unusedCacheIds.contains(cache.getCacheId())) {","+                continue;","+            }","+            String rId = cache.getId();","+            caches.removePivotCache(i);","+            if (rId != null && getRelationById(rId) != null) {","+                removeRelation(rId);","+            }","+        }","+        if (caches.sizeOfPivotCacheArray() == 0) {","+            workbook.unsetPivotCaches();","+        }","+    }","+","     /**","      * Gracefully remove references to the sheet being deleted","      *","@@ -2463,10 +2510,13 @@ protected CTPivotCache addPivotCache(String rId) {","         } else {","             caches = ctWorkbook.addNewPivotCaches();","         }","+        